# BCcampus question bank attribution

*Adult Literacy Fundamental Mathematics* (2nd edition), published by BCcampus in 2023.

- Book 4, copyright © 2023 Katherine Arendt, Mercedes de la Nuez, and Liz Girard. [Book 4](https://opentextbc.ca/alfm4/)
- Book 5, copyright © 2023 Liz Girard, Wendy Tagami, and Leanne Caillier-Smith. [Book 5](https://opentextbc.ca/alfm5/)

The EPUBs also identify © 2010-2023 Province of British Columbia Ministry of Post-Secondary Education and Future Skills. Both books use the [Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) except where otherwise noted. Download the originals from the [B.C. Open Collection](https://collection.bccampus.ca/).

This collection uses text and equations from selected exercises and public keys. Ailleo adapted the instructions and response formats and transcribed equations into LaTeX. The original book covers are separately licensed. The Book 4 cover by Jenny Johnson carries CC BY-NC-SA 2.0. The Book 5 cover by Philippa Willitts carries CC BY-NC 2.0.

Ailleo's separately authored worked explanations use the [Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International license](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/). The original BCcampus exercise text and answer keys remain available under CC BY 4.0. The source index identifies the relevant credit for each question and worked method.
